# Line endings are LF everywhere - in the repository and in the working tree on
# every platform. Without this the stored ending is whatever the contributing
# machine happened to write, which is how one CRLF file reached the history and
# made a two-line edit read as a full-file rewrite in `git diff`.
#
# `text=auto` still detects binary content, so `eol=lf` never touches it; the
# one binary in the tree is listed below anyway, so the intent is explicit
# rather than inferred.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
